Describes each tap step in the phase tap changer tabular curve.

	"""@en ;
  ns0:Package "Package_CoreEquipmentProfile" .

<http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#PhaseTapChangerTablePoint.angle>
  a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
  rdfs:label "angle"@en ;
  rdfs:domain <http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#PhaseTapChangerTablePoint> ;
  rdfs:range <http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100#AngleDegrees> ;
  skos:definition """
The angle difference in degrees. A positive value indicates a positive angle variation from the Terminal at the  PowerTransformerEnd,  where the TapChanger is located, into the transformer.

